{"id":"u-973f1945-8250-4d45-9451-ad66b5975f5f","src":"community","title":"Sculpted & Strong: 12-Week Glow-Up🧘🏻‍♀️🪽","author":"alexa","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/rPGBMv-untitled-program","desc":"SCULPTED & STRONG - 12 WEEK GLOW UP✨\n\nbig glutes • small waist • toned back & arms\n\nthe goal: feel GOOD, look GOOD, get STRONGER 💗\n\nthis is a 12-week gym program made to help you grow your 🍑, build a more defined-looking waist, and get that toned back + arms you’ve been wanting.\n\n📈 WEIGHT PROGRESSION\n\n• Exercise says 3 × 8–12 → work toward 12 reps\n• Start with a weight you can control 🎀\n• Example: 10/10/9 → 11/10/10 → 12/11/10 → 12/12/12 ✅\n• Hit 12/12/12 with good form? → GO UP IN WEIGHT ⬆️\n• New weight might look like 10/9/8 → THAT’S OKAY!!\n• Build your reps back up → then increase again 💗\n• Don’t add weight just because it’s a new week\n• Good form > heavier weight 🫶🏼\n\nevery workout is already planned out for you — you just walk into the gym, look at the day, and get to work.\n\nMON 🎂 glutes + hamstrings\nTUE 🎀 back + biceps\nWED 🎂 glutes + quads\nTHU 🎀shoulders + arms + back\nFRI 🎂 glute growth\nSAT ✨ optional cardio + core\nSUN 💤 rest\n\nexpect heavy lifts, high reps, good form & LOTS of PUMP 🫦🙌🏻\n\nthe goal isn’t to be perfect.\nit’s to show up, push yourself, track your progress & keep going.\n\n12 weeks. 5–6 days a week.\nlet’s build the body AND confidence. 🫶🏼","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Women's","Bodyweight Fitness","Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-24T21:30:36.877Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["🕺🏻- glutes & hamstrings pump","🪽- back & bi pump","🕺🏻- glutes & quads light","🪽- shoulders & back & arms light","🕺🏻- glute pump","🧖🏻‍♀️- core/abs & (your choice)","🧘🏻‍♀️rest day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Treadmill","sets":[{"sec":360}]},{"n":"Hip Thrust (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"